  "title": "A Message of Focus. A Commitment to You.",
  "summary": "In the face of recent transitions, our purpose is clearer than ever: to earn and deepen your trust. Across aerospace, defense, automotive, and advanced manufacturing, you’ve told us what matters most: reliability, uptime, support, and outcomes that scale. This is the foundation we’re building on. We see enormous opportunity ahead, and we’re committed to earning your trust through quality, care, and consistent execution.This is more than a message—it’s a renewed promise to deliver the outcomes your business depends on.",
